<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>We Don't Wanna Talk</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Friday Pilots Club</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Nowhere</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">7Gzs6HvJBEBSxsNkXwBqay</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.869" end="00:11.758">She don't wanna talk about it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.758" end="00:13.550">But I really wanna know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.550" end="00:16.076">Settle down, no five year plans</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.076" end="00:17.696">No rules, no place to go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.696" end="00:20.235">Gotta say I love the way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.235" end="00:21.984">She gotta hold a place</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.984" end="00:24.446">For the hope that has for me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.446" end="00:26.157">Long since gone away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.157" end="00:30.561">Oooh, just think it through</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.561" end="00:35.710">What's there to lose when the house is taking it all?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.710" end="00:41.375">Oooh, I'm next to you, don't wanna move</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.375" end="00:49.375">And we don't wanna talk about it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.369" end="00:52.881">We don't wanna talk about it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.881" end="00:54.924">Who lives to love the outcome?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.924" end="00:56.542">I'm down to let it go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.542" end="00:59.236">But still I crave an answer</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.236" end="01:00.789">I don't need to know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.789" end="01:04.596">The way it goes and who's getting away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.596" end="01:07.096">We've seen it all before</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.096" end="01:09.731">It always ends the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.731" end="01:11.381">She thinks I'm a saint</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.381" end="01:14.927">But divinity was never the aim</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.927" end="01:18.578">And we don't wanna talk about</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.578" end="01:20.249">Repercussions, babe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.249" end="01:24.648">It's a dangerous, dangerous game</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.648" end="01:32.648">And we don't wanna talk about it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.480" end="01:41.480">We don't wanna talk about it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.422" end="01:47.819">Oooh, just think it through</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.819" end="01:53.319">What's there to lose when the house is taking it all?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.319" end="01:58.834">Oooh, I'm next to you, don't wanna move</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.834" end="02:00.970">No, I can't let go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.970" end="02:02.893">She thinks I'm a saint</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.893" end="02:07.440">But divinity was never the aim</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.440" end="02:09.919">And we don't wanna talk about</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.919" end="02:11.419">Repercussions, babe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.614" end="02:15.247">It's a dangerous, dangerous game</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.247" end="02:23.247">And we don't wanna talk about it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.291" end="02:31.291">We don't wanna talk about it</p></div></body></tt>